sOEYpEr2J8DGRHBxLUKQ&oe=69A438D1"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5.png", "id": "951903810294618", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974503_951903813627951_935484385240937317_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-djeyOrKPpAQ7kNvwFgpOFL&_nc_oc=AdnY93dL2kkX4OK1U2ckNetKN6NYDRJ0tLAMW7kQrdXzfwRFrtmhonfDVwFfJIuWZoY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs0sczQrOrVP8KXk5jjm7IoIYVUTt63O_x2I06fYfjb4g&oe=69A42BF5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Modoium", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Modoium : The New Standard in Unity Development\n\nDeveloping Android, iOS, iPad or VR content with Unity? Revolutionize your development process with Modoium.\n\n**Key Features :**\n1. Instant Testing: See results on your test devices without building and installing the entire project.\n2. Superior Quality: Automatically supports native resolution and frame rate of test devices, delivering top-notch visuals and audio.\n3. Wireless Connection: Easily connect via Wi-Fi and use multiple devices on the local network.\n4. Multi-Platform Support: Covers iOS, Android, PadOS and VR.\n5. Security: Prevents unauthorized access through verification codes.\n\n**Why Modoium?**\n- Time-Saving: Escape the endless cycle of building, installing, and testing.\n- Increased Productivity: Speed up development with instant feedback.\n- Improved Quality: Verify exact performance on real devices.\n- Cost-Effective: Reduce the need for multiple test devices.\n\nUpgrade your Unity development experience with Modoium. Start now!", "short_description": "Modoium is a Unity mobile game development test acceleration tool. Connect to Unity Editor via Wi-Fi for instant testing, and save build-copy-install time to focus on improving your game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://modoium.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Clicked, Inc.", "support_w